    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"974\"><em data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"974\">(3rd Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1022\"><em data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1022\">“Nothing is ever lost. It is only misfiled.”</em></p><p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1072\">You gain controlled access to the Akashic Layer.</p><ul data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1404\"><li data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1149\"><p data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1149\">You may maintain <strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1127\">+1 additional active Precedent</strong> beyond normal limits.</p></li><li data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1404\"><p data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1223\">When you create a Precedent, you must specify which aspect is recorded:</p><ul data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1404\"><li data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1256\"><p data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1256\"><strong data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1238\">Intent</strong> (why it was done)</p></li><li data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1288\"><p data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1288\"><strong data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1272\">Outcome</strong> (what happened)</p></li><li data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1321\"><p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1321\"><strong data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1303\">Method</strong> (how it was done)</p></li><li data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1353\"><p data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1353\"><strong data-start=\"1326\" data-end=\"1334\">Cost</strong> (what it required)</p></li><li data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1404\"><p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1404\"><strong data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1378\">Emotional Weight</strong> (fear, hope, shame, etc.)</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1487\">That chosen aspect “sticks hardest” and is the most enforceable when cited later.</p><h3 data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1517\">Civic Charge Interaction</h3><p data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1650\">When you spend a Civic Charge die to interact with that Precedent, the recorded aspect gains narrative priority during adjudication.</p><h3 data-start=\"1652\" data-end=\"1669\">Pushback Risk</h3><p data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1785\">Recording too many events too quickly can generate <strong data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1748\">Administrative Pressure</strong>. Lore (Mind) resists being micromanaged.</p>",
